Files and directory of distibution:

README		this text
COPYING		GPL.v2 license text
LICENSE		MIT license text
COMPILE		instructions how to build binaries including historical notes
COMPILE.ru	obsoleted instruction in russian
VERSION		version of distibution
WISHES		noted an ideas for future enhancements
PLAN		nearest plan of fixes (not in order)
BUGS		fixes required

MK-srpm.sh, DEBIAN, DEBIAN.sh	- scripts to build packages

configure	script for configuring compiling (not a GNU toolchain but compatible)
conf/		specs and configuration variants
Makefile	main makefile

bin/		scripts to be installed with compiled binaries
etc/		samples of terminal configs from vhset, installed as /etc/vhset
lib/		source of help pages
misc/		miscellaneous staff
rc/		rc files and profiles
vash/		sources of vash main binary
vash.1		manual sources
vhset/		vhset utility sources
vhset.1		vhset manual
visi/		embedded VISI project with obsoleted manuals in russian
vtest/		test program for debug VISI itself

